    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Stack are delighted to bring this traditional-style 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom cottage to the market.\nSet in a peaceful and picturesque rural location, the property occupies a generous mature site extending to approximately 0.43 hectares (1.06 acres), featuring well-maintained lawns, mature trees and established shrubbery.\nThe property is conveniently located just 2km from the village of Mountcollins, where a range of local amenities are available, including a primary school, pub, GAA club, church and more. The market town of Abbeyfeale is approximately a 10-minute drive away, offering a wider selection of shops, services and amenities.\nAccommodation comprises an entrance hallway, lounge/sitting room, kitchen/dining room, two compact double bedrooms and a shower room with W.C. and wash hand basin. There is also a further bedroom located in the attic.\nThe property benefits from a mains water supply, on-site septic tank and double-glazed uPVC windows throughout.\nExternally, there is a detached 8m x 3.5m outbuilding, which provides excellent additional storage space and would be ideal for DIY, workshop or hobby purposes.\nWith its peaceful countryside setting, generous mature site and convenient proximity to Mountcollins and Abbeyfeale, this property offers considerable potential and would make an ideal retirement home, holiday retreat or permanent residence."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 1.23m x 0.87m\nwith linoleum flooring and glazed door to front\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 4.64m x 3.21m\nwith open fireplace, linoleum flooring & 2 windows (dual aspect)\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 3.63m x 2.60m\nfitted kitchen with wooden laminate flooring, wall tiles, 2 windows (dual aspect)\n\nSide Entrance - 1.68m x 1.15m\nwith floor tiles, 1/2 glazed door to rear\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.02m x 2.24m\ndouble room with linoleum flooring, wood paneling & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.02m x 2.23m\ndouble room with wooden flooring, wood paneling & window\n\nShower Room - 2.37m x 1.60m\nwet room with Triton T80 electric shower, wall & floor tils, whb, w/c & window\n\n1st Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.63m x 3.06m\ndouble with linoleum flooring & window\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>3 bedroom, 1 bathroom traditional style cottage </li><li>0.43 hectares (1.06 acres) mature site</li><li>Peaceful countryside setting</li><li>Just 1.5km from the village of Mountcollins</li><li>10-minute drive from the market town of Abbeyfeale </li><li>Well-maintained lawns, mature trees and established shrubbery.</li><li>Mains water supply, on-site septic tank and double-glazed uPVC windows throughout.</li><li>Detached 8m x 3.5m outbuilding- ideal for DIY, workshop or hobby purposes</li><li>Ideal retirement home, holiday retreat or permanent residence.</li><li></li><li>Distances: </li><li>Abbeyfeale 10 mins </li><li>Newcastle West 20 mins </li><li>Limerick 1 hour</ul>"
